  "title": "Oklo Publishes First Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Business Update",
  "summary": "Oklo Inc. (NYSE: OKLO) (“Oklo” or “the Company”), an advanced nuclear technology company, today published its financial results and business update for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026. Oklo will host a conference call today, May 12, 2026, at 2:00 p.m. Pacific Time / 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time. Jacob DeWitte, Co-Founder and Chief Executive Officer, and Craig Bealmear, Chief Financial Officer, will speak on the call. A webcast of the call can be accessed by visiting the Events Presentatio",
